y" fontSize="9.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>AI 审查 AI：双分区防合谋、六步协议、26 类错误分级</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="66" topLeftY="336" width="183" height="36" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(232,240,246)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="76" topLeftY="342" width="163" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="middle" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>15 个审计版本 · 6 轮泄漏审计 · 68 个真实 CVE 对齐修 11 处</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="269" topLeftY="118" width="207" height="262" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="269" topLeftY="118" width="207" height="4" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill></shape><icon iconType="iconpark/Base/setting.svg" topLeftX="285" topLeftY="136" width="26" height="26"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill></icon><shape type="text" topLeftX="321" topLeftY="134" width="140" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="15" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>工程层</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="321" topLeftY="158" width="140" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8" color="rgb(111,163,155)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>LAYER 02 · ENGINEERING</p></content></shape><line startX="283" startY="178" endX="462" endY="178"><border color="rgb(220,224,228)" width="1"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="283" topLeftY="186" width="180" height="12"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" color="rgb(111,163,155)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpaci